#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""packs/education.py ,  the education disciplines specialization.

Covers: Primary Education Studies, Early Childhood Education, Science/
Arts/Social Science Education, Educational Foundations, Guidance and
Counselling, Special Education, Adult Education, Educational Technology
and library-oriented education courses.

Every atom teaches real education science: Piaget, Vygotsky, Skinner,
Bloom, the Nigerian National Policy on Education, UBE, TRCN, continuous
assessment and the lesson plan. Content is written so it reads naturally
for any education subject phrase routed to this pack.
"""

