        ("fill", "Fill: The ADDIE cycle runs Analysis, Design, Development, Implementation and ____.", "Evaluation", ["Evaluation"], "Evaluation closes the ADDIE cycle, formative during and summative at the end."),
        ("fill", "Fill: In Dale's cone, the base level of direct purposeful experience represents learning by ____.", "doing", ["doing"], "The cone begins with concrete doing and climbs toward words and symbols."),
